  "sentence_translations": {
    "道可道,非常道。": "The Way that can be spoken of is not the eternal Way.",
    "名可名,非常名。": "The name that can be named is not the eternal Name.",
    "无名,天地之始;有名,万物之母。": "Nameless, it is the origin of heaven and earth; named, it is the mother of the myriad things.",
    "故常无欲,以观其妙;常有欲,以观其徼。": "Therefore, ever desireless, one perceives its mystery; ever desiring, one perceives its manifestations.",
    "此两者,同出而异名,同谓之玄。": "These two emerge from the same source yet bear different names; together they are called the Mystery.",
    "玄之又玄,众妙之门。": "Mystery upon mystery — the gate of all wonders."
  }
